GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-machine

::: post
test("a revoked token gets a 401, Postino does not retry on its own", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(401);
  expect(res.headers.get("www-authenticate")).toContain("invalid_token");
});

::: docs
Run after `revoke-all`: the stored token of `sample-machine` is still valid for Postino but the
API rejects it. The response shows "Get new token and resend".
